# MMU image (doc/stage2_plan.md, doc/video_plan.md): as board/tang9k's, plus devpts (ptys for
# `script`) and the console shell mirrored onto the HDMI text console.
::sysinit:/bin/mount -t proc proc /proc
::sysinit:/bin/mount -t sysfs sysfs /sys
